WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.067
Molecules are hard, in principle.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.704
Only electrons, fixed nuclei and Coulomb forces.

3
00:00:05.854 --> 00:00:08.587
Estimating the lowest energy becomes the problem.

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.393
Encode a known hard quantum problem in

5
00:00:11.393 --> 00:00:13.586
where nuclei sit; the energy answers it.

6
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.031
Claimed: as hard as quantum verification.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.359
Lean-checked main theorem.
